        "x1": 234.2,
        "tag": "title",
        "text": "A Preparing for interviews"
      },
      {
        "y": 87.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 455.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "When companies are recruiting1, they often have a set of criteria2 (e.g. three years of"
      },
      {
        "y": 100.6,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 490.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "experience in the field, or a degree in a relevant area) which they use to find the most suitable"
      },
      {
        "y": 111.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 483.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "candidates. If you are shortlisted3 for an interview, make sure you do your homework first:"
      },
      {
        "y": 124.6,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 468.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "find out as much as you can about the company, its products, markets, competitors, etc."
      },
      {
        "y": 135.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 471,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "If you can, ask a friend to do a trial run4 with you. This will help boost5 your confidence."
      },
      {
        "y": 148.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 483.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "The interview may be conducted by a panel [a group of people], probably including your future"
      },
      {
        "y": 159.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 491.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "line manager6. Don’t forget to make eye contact with all the interviewers while you are talking."
      },
      {
        "y": 171.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 470.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "As you arrive for the interview, body language7 is important. Give a firm handshake and"
      },
      {
        "y": 183.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 346.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "speak up8. This will help to create a good first impression."
      },
      {
        "y": 199.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 508.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 hiring (new staff) 2 requirements you use to make a decision 3 selected from a larger group 4 a practice"
      },
      {
        "y": 211.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 510,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "of something new 5 improve or increase 6 the person who is directly responsible for your work 7 physical"
      },
      {
        "y": 223.5,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 398.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "movements which show how you are feeling 8 speak (more) loudly and clearly"
      },
      {
        "y": 244.5,
        "x0": 74.7,
        "x1": 208.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "B During an interview"
      },
      {
        "y": 262.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 376.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "These are examples of things that might be said at a job interview."
      },
      {
        "y": 282.1,
        "x0": 48.1,
        "x1": 203.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "A: So, can you talk us through1 your CV?"
      },
      {
        "y": 302.6,
        "x0": 62.2,
        "x1": 320.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "B: Well, I studied Engineering and then took a job as a trainee2 at F3"
      },
      {
        "y": 314.7,
        "x0": 73.5,
        "x1": 107.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Telecom."
      },
      {
        "y": 337.4,
        "x0": 65.6,
        "x1": 327.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "A: I’d like to ask about opportunities for professional development3."
      },
      {
        "y": 357.9,
        "x0": 47.8,
        "x1": 314.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "B: We have a very good in-house4 training programme for new recruits5."
      },
      {
        "y": 376.4,
        "x0": 350.8,
        "x1": 506.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 tell us about in more detail 2 a person"
      },
      {
        "y": 382.5,
        "x0": 48.1,
        "x1": 318.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Can you give us an example of how you’ve worked well under pressure?"
      },
      {
        "y": 388.4,
        "x0": 350.7,
        "x1": 512.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "who is learning a new job 3 training given"
      },
      {
        "y": 401.5,
        "x0": 350.8,
        "x1": 517.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "to employees to increase their knowledge or"
      },
      {
