        "x1": 515.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Reply Forward"
      },
      {
        "y": 567.1,
        "x0": 110.5,
        "x1": 165,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Dear Mr Malton,"
      },
      {
        "y": 579.8,
        "x0": 110.5,
        "x1": 488.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Thank you for attending the interview last week. We very much enjoyed meeting you.We are delighted to offer you"
      },
      {
        "y": 588.9,
        "x0": 110.5,
        "x1": 489.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "the position of Trainee Programmer. We believe your qualifications and experience will be an ideal fit for1 the job."
      },
      {
        "y": 601.7,
        "x0": 110.5,
        "x1": 464.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Please review the attached document outlining2 your salary, benefits (including paid leave3) and reporting"
      },
      {
        "y": 611.7,
        "x0": 110.5,
        "x1": 476.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "structure4, and sign where indicated. Return the document within five business days. Once we have received the"
      },
