        "y": 622.6,
        "x0": 110.5,
        "x1": 305.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "paperwork, we will contact you to arrange your start date."
      },
      {
        "y": 635.6,
        "x0": 110.5,
        "x1": 293.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "We look forward to welcoming you as part of our team."
      },
      {
