      {
        "y": 71.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 354,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Look at A and fill in the tips for a successful interview."
      },
      {
        "y": 88,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 516.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 Before the interview, your : find out as much as you can about the"
      },
      {
        "y": 100,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 393.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "company and prepare answers to common interview questions."
      },
      {
        "y": 112,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 485.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "2 If you can, do a to practise how you will answer the interview questions."
      },
      {
        "y": 124,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 526.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "3 You need to create a good with the interviewers. Dress smartly and professionally."
      },
      {
        "y": 136,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 522,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4 Remember that your also plays an important part. Don’t forget to smile! This will"
      },
      {
        "y": 148,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 479.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "make you seem more friendly, and might actually your confidence too."
      },
      {
        "y": 160,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 525.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "5 Make sure you greet your interviewer with a . Make when you talk to"
      },
      {
        "y": 172,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 248.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "them – look at them directly."
      },
      {
        "y": 184,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 507,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "6 During the interview, describe all your relevant education and experience to show how you"
      },
      {
        "y": 196,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 279.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "fulfil all the for the job."
      },
      {
        "y": 212.3,
        "x0": 85.1,
        "x1": 102,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4.2"
      },
      {
        "y": 214.9,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 404.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Choose the correct word from A and B to complete the sentences."
      },
      {
        "y": 231.3,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 499.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 I’m afraid you’ll have to speak up / eye up / head up. I can hardly hear what you’re saying."
      },
      {
        "y": 243.3,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 467.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "2 We are taking / recruiting / searching people for our new branch in the city centre."
      },
      {
        "y": 255.3,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 466.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "3 If we can’t fill / fulfil / supply the post internally, we’ll have to advertise externally."
      },
      {
        "y": 267.3,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 485.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4 If I get the new job, I will have to take up / over / on more responsibility, but I will get a"
      },
      {
        "y": 279.3,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 192.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "salary increase."
      },
      {
        "y": 291.3,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 482.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "5 I don’t like working under pressure / under stress / by force. I end up making mistakes."
      },
      {
        "y": 303.3,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 502.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "6 As part of the programme of reporting structure / professional development / notice period,"
      },
      {
        "y": 315.3,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 396.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "we would like to invite you to a session on project management."
      },
      {
        "y": 331.7,
        "x0": 85.1,
        "x1": 102,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4.3"
      },
      {
        "y": 334.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 412,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Rewrite the following sentences using expressions from A, B and C."
      },
      {
        "y": 350.7,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 384.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 Could you tell us about your previous experience in this field?"
      },
      {
        "y": 362.7,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 452.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "2 I think we should give the job to Ruth. She seems perfectly suited to the team."
      },
      {
        "y": 374.7,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 306.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "3 Employees are entitled to 30 days’ holiday."
      },
      {
        "y": 386.7,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 392.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4 The group of interviewers will include your future line manager."
      },
      {
        "y": 398.7,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 519.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "5 They just called me to say I have been chosen (as one of the best candidates) for an interview."
      },
      {
        "y": 415,
        "x0": 85.1,
        "x1": 102,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4.4"
      },
      {
        "y": 417.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 443.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Look at B and C opposite. There is one mistake in each of these sentences."
      },
      {
        "y": 429.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 211.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Correct the mistakes."
      },
      {
        "y": 446,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 425.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 Please find attached a document overviewing your working conditions."
      },
